[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5398513901","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122772#issuecomment-5398513901","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122772","id":5398513901,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQcbI7Q","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T16:55:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T16:55:36Z","body":"I don't think this is a good way to fix this. Yeah an enum is just an int at runtime. But `Key.KEY_0` is typewise still of the enum type `Key`. In my mind the issue lies with the code that suggests those options based on the enum type. It is probably not respecting the metatype flag (assuming we consistently apply the flag to enums).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5398513901/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5398833322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122772#issuecomment-5398833322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122772","id":5398833322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQcuoqg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T17:23:49Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T17:23:49Z","body":"Alright, I've started looking into approaches that take advantage of the `DataType.is_meta_type` field. So far I've found that on line 3632:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/eda23e608e999365cbfeffdf5c73a6bc77a581f1/modules/gdscript/gdscript_editor.cpp#L3629-L3635\r\n\r\nAdding the extra condition `&& !attr->base->type_constraint.is_meta_type` _does_ fix it... but (as you probably already guessed) it also prevents code completion for properties in most other cases too 😅.\r\n\r\nI'll need to work on some other things for a while, but if you think this sounds like the start of a better approach, though, later today I may be able to combine this with checking if the base type is an enum. So, the logic of the PR would be \"if its type is enum, and it's not a meta type, then avoid code completion\".","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5398833322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5398892379","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122772#issuecomment-5398892379","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122772","id":5398892379,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQcyPWw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T17:28:21Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T17:28:21Z","body":"I would have expected a check for meta types somewhere around [here](https://github.com/HolonProduction/godot/blob/d488d11119b4e0c67619b0c720d7c335ad2d0565/modules/gdscript/gdscript_editor.cpp#L1504) should fix it (if enums do correctly get the flag).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5398892379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5399733718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122772#issuecomment-5399733718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122772","id":5399733718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQdll1g","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-24T18:42:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-24T18:42:00Z","body":"Thank you very much for the suggestion! I took a look in there and did some testing, and it appears that a) there's not currently any checks in that spot for if it's a meta type, and b) the meta type status is correctly set by the time that code is reached. As such, I've changed the PR's approach to add a simple check which cancels out of the attempt to find identifiers for suggestion if it detects the base type is an enum but not a meta type (to my knowledge, an enum _value_ instead of an enum _type name_).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5399733718/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5413082465","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122772#issuecomment-5413082465","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122772","id":5413082465,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQqUVYQ","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T15:55:09Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T15:55:09Z","body":"Thanks for the review! I'll look into adding a test case for it today 😄 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5413082465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5413533202","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122772#issuecomment-5413533202","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122772","id":5413533202,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQqv2Eg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-25T16:32:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T16:33:19Z","body":"I've added test cases for several different ways that this bug could be triggered:\r\n```gdscript\r\n# GlobalScope enums\r\nvar a = KEY_0. \r\nvar b = Key.KEY_0.\r\n\r\n# \"Local\" but built-in enums\r\n# (Examples here assume script extends Control)\r\nvar c = ANCHOR_BEGIN.\r\nvar d = Anchor.ANCHOR_BEGIN.\r\n```\r\nSince each pair of test files can only account for one case, this means eight total files added for checking for this behavior, which does feel like a lot 😅 So if you feel some of these test cases can be removed, please let me know and I'll be happy to remove them. (Of course, on the other hand if there are important cases to test that I've missed here, I can add those as well!)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5413533202/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5424995398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122772#issuecomment-5424995398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122772","id":5424995398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQ1rcRg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-26T12:04:39Z","updated_at":"2026-08-26T12:04:39Z","body":"I think a test for script enums would make sense as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5424995398/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoora